e mutated from exposure to the bio attack. The theory is that the virus adapted to running low on host to infect. It altered itself to survive and feast on similar hosts in the genetic structure. After running low on humanoids it moved to native wildlife, first starting with mammals, then quickly moving its way down the tree of life, one by one eradicating or mutating whole species. Flayl will feature dynamic corruption and events that spreads across the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Modding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824530/extras/9ca606abdc0298e87599efa3ba6176fc.avif?t=1744921391\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl will have a fairly wide range of weapon modding for creative freedom in gun designs, melee weapons, along with weapon mechanics to fine tune build your weapons how you like them with a mix of internal parts and attachments you can make any weapon truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Land Water and Air</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl features vehicles for land water, and air take your enemies out of the sky, off the ground or in the deep ocean while cave diving for loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons O' Plenty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl features a large range of weapon types, ranging from Melee weapons to guns, to throwables &amp; much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824530/extras/d33c1cec4c2328de5327335c1e23137c.avif?t=1744921391\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl features loads of crafting options, in raid and out of raid. From ammo, to tools to weapons, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simulated Projectiles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl guns use simulated projectiles for performance reasons, but don't worry, they still have simulated ballistics. Flayl also utilizes physically accurate directional melee combat, that heavily changes and depends on the weapon you are using.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Directional Melee Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl features a directional melee combat system, this tied in with our Pocket Sand Physics and physical based balance system offers a very unique and intriguing melee play style that it alone can compete with all other weapons in Flayl, including, but not limited to guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl offers very diverse options for how you can play, and how you wish to build your character. With a mix of active &amp; passive skill options, you can truly build your character how you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Consumables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824530/extras/b9dff542ea92ebbffa5aad842ea3d0f1.avif?t=1744921391\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl features loads of consumables, from food and drink to stay alive, to injectors / medicines to enhance your player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Utilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl offers many utilities to change the battlefield. From throwable explosives, remote detonated explosives, to bubble shields that block ranged attacks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of Wildlife</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flayl features a large range of friendly to hostile mutated creatures, from ground creatures to flying creatures, to oceanic creatures.</p>",
